{
  "tema": 8527,
  "slug": "se-aspectual",
  "titulo": "Se aspectual: comerse, leerse, saberse",
  "subtitulo": "Se comió todo el pastel. Me sé la canción.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Adding a reflexive pronoun to verbs like comer, beber, leer, saber, aprender, ver gives the action a sense of completion or personal involvement: Comió pastel (ate some cake) vs Se comió el pastel (ate up the cake). It needs a specific object, usually with an article or a quantity.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Comer** reports what happened; **comerse** stresses that it was finished, all of it, often with some feeling."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Common verbs: **comerse, beberse / tomarse, leerse, verse (una serie), aprenderse, saberse, creerse, fumarse, ganarse**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It needs a **definite, limited object**: **se comió el pastel / tres tacos**, not ~~se comió pastel~~."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "English often uses _up, down, through, all_: _eat up, drink down, read through_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **se** = _the whole thing_."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tabla",
      "titulo": "Without and with se",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "neutral",
            "with se",
            "nuance"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "Laura comió una manzana.",
              "Laura se comió una manzana.",
              "ate it up"
            ],
            [
              "Tomó cerveza.",
              "Se tomó la cerveza.",
              "drank the whole thing"
            ],
            [
              "Leyó el libro.",
              "Se leyó el libro en un día.",
              "read it right through"
            ],
            [
              "Sé la respuesta.",
              "Me sé la canción de memoria.",
              "know it by heart"
            ],
            [
              "Vimos la serie.",
              "Nos vimos la serie entera.",
              "binged it"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
